photo = load "landscape.png"
background 245
image photo at 10 10 width 120
image (filter photo as gray) at 140 10 width 120
image (filter photo as invert) at 270 10 width 120
image (filter photo as blur by 5) at 10 100 width 120
image (filter photo as threshold by 110) at 140 100 width 120
image (filter photo as edges) at 270 100 width 120
image (filter photo as posterize by 3) at 10 190 width 120
image (filter photo as pixelate by 6) at 140 190 width 120
